      "writtenOn": "2023-04-11T20:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One the one hand, I feel like if it\u0027s only used in one place (`toKey()`), it\u0027s nice to just have it inline there so toKey highlights the overarching paint tree structure we\u0027re building. The same could be said for AddDstBlendBlock.\n\nThat said, the tree AddFooBlendBlocks all follow a very consistent structure so it\u0027s nice having the three of them defined together. I\u0027m fine leaving AddPrimitiveBlendBlock defined.",
      "parentUuid": "504c7565_ac0dd924",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 115,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "3899307a252ce270745133d5483b062b41ad9d48",
